    "The agent reads %@ and adds what's useful: trains, flights, hotels, costs. Uses points." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "助手会读取“%@”并添加有用的信息：火车、航班、酒店、费用。会消耗点数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "助手會讀取「%@」並新增有用的資訊：火車、航班、酒店、費用。會消耗點數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent reads it and updates a trip diary: bookings, trains, hotels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "助手会读取内容并更新行程日记：预订、火车、酒店。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "助手會讀取內容並更新行程日記：預訂、火車、酒店。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent will update %@. You'll get a notification when it's done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "助手将更新“%@”。完成后你会收到通知。"
